# MIT CMS Framework V1

MIT CMS adalah framework internal MIT Technology untuk membangun website company profile premium secara cepat, konsisten, dan scalable.

## Core CMS

* Homepage
* About
* Services / Solutions
* Portfolio
* Contact
* Site Settings

## Growth CMS

Semua fitur Core CMS +

* Packages
* Navbar CMS
* Footer CMS
* Lead Form
* Supabase Leads
* Dashboard Leads
* Export CSV
* SEO Settings

## Enterprise CMS

Semua fitur Growth CMS +

* Blog / Articles
* Authors
* Categories
* Media Library
* Multi User
* Analytics
* CRM Leads
* AI Chat Assistant
* Custom Dashboard
